现在一般都是计划炼药，因为计划里的每条指令都是完全结束后才跳到下一条执行
不用机器人检测busy等，所以推荐scheme make

下面是我的scheme样本，你可以自己改，把药材放箱子，或者用丹玉磨代替一般研钵


定义九花alias
"alias gbo get bo from xiang";"alias pbo put bo in xiang";"alias gwan get wan from bo";
"alias g1 get 20 tianqi from xiang";
"alias g2 get 20 chenpi from xiang";
"alias g3 get 20 danggui from xiang";
"alias g4 get 20 renshen from xiang";
"alias g5 get 20 xiongdan from xiang";
"alias g6 get 20 yang jinhua from xiang";
"alias g7 get 20 zihua from xiang";
"alias g8 get 20 shouwu from xiang";
"alias g9 get 20 lanhua from xiang";
"alias g10 get 20 juhua from xiang";
"alias g11 get 20 moyao from xiang";
"alias g12 get 20 honghua from xiang";
"alias d1 put tianqi in xiang";
"alias d2 put chenpi in xiang";
"alias d3 put danggui in xiang";
"alias d4 put renshen in xiang";
"alias d5 put xiongdan in xiang";
"alias d6 put yang jinhua in xiang";
"alias d7 put zihua in xiang";
"alias d8 put shouwu in xiang";
"alias d9 put lanhua in xiang";
"alias d10 put juhua in xiang";
"alias d11 put moyao in xiang";
"alias d12 put honghua in xiang";
scheme edit;
"REPEAT";
d1;d2;d3;d4;d5;d6;d7;d8;d9;d10;d11;d12;
g1;g2;g3;g4;g5;g6;g7;g8;g9;g10;g11;g12;
gbo;"hand bo";
"REPEAT";
gwan;"put wan in xiang";"make 九花玉露丸:BREAK";
sleep;
"LOOP";
pbo;
"LOOP";.



